# M-000 — Foundation Stabilized

**Status:** Active  
**Target gate:** 2026-08-16 (forecast)

## Outcome

Monad has one coherent product/architecture thesis, singular ADR authority, substantive artifact catalog, synchronized machine layer, MVP backlog, and reproducible GitHub operating plan.

## Exit criteria

- STAB transition register has no unresolved blocker preventing MVP planning;
- machine sync check passes;
- critical foundation documents agree on Monad identity;
- first three MVP Sprints have Ready-candidate Work Packets;
- GitHub setup is configured or has exact reproducible owner actions;
- Foundation Stabilization Review authorizes PI-001.

The date is an aggressive forecast and may move rather than bypass the gate.

